{"docKey":"BM81.买卖股票的最好时机(二)","code":"from typing import List\n\n\nclass Solution:\n    def maxProfit(self, prices: List[int]) -> int:\n        \"\"\"多次交易：累加所有相邻正差价\"\"\"\n        profit = 0\n        for i in range(1, len(prices)):\n            if prices[i] > prices[i - 1]:\n                profit += prices[i] - prices[i - 1]\n        return profit","method":"maxProfit","paramNames":["prices"],"args":["[8,9,2,5,4,7,1]"],"expected":"7","result":7,"events":[{"line":7,"locals":{"prices":[8,9,2,5,4,7,1]},"depth":1},{"line":8,"locals":{"prices":[8,9,2,5,4,7,1],"profit":0},"depth":1},{"line":9,"locals":{"prices":[8,9,2,5,4,7,1],"profit":0,"i":1},"depth":1},{"line":10,"locals":{"prices":[8,9,2,5,4,7,1],"profit":0,"i":1},"depth":1},{"line":8,"locals":{"prices":[8,9,2,5,4,7,1],"profit":1,"i":1},"depth":1},{"line":9,"locals":{"prices":[8,9,2,5,4,7,1],"profit":1,"i":2},"depth":1},{"line":8,"locals":{"prices":[8,9,2,5,4,7,1],"profit":1,"i":2},"depth":1},{"line":9,"locals":{"prices":[8,9,2,5,4,7,1],"profit":1,"i":3},"depth":1},{"line":10,"locals":{"prices":[8,9,2,5,4,7,1],"profit":1,"i":3},"depth":1},{"line":8,"locals":{"prices":[8,9,2,5,4,7,1],"profit":4,"i":3},"depth":1},{"line":9,"locals":{"prices":[8,9,2,5,4,7,1],"profit":4,"i":4},"depth":1},{"line":8,"locals":{"prices":[8,9,2,5,4,7,1],"profit":4,"i":4},"depth":1},{"line":9,"locals":{"prices":[8,9,2,5,4,7,1],"profit":4,"i":5},"depth":1},{"line":10,"locals":{"prices":[8,9,2,5,4,7,1],"profit":4,"i":5},"depth":1},{"line":8,"locals":{"prices":[8,9,2,5,4,7,1],"profit":7,"i":5},"depth":1},{"line":9,"locals":{"prices":[8,9,2,5,4,7,1],"profit":7,"i":6},"depth":1},{"line":8,"locals":{"prices":[8,9,2,5,4,7,1],"profit":7,"i":6},"depth":1},{"line":11,"locals":{"prices":[8,9,2,5,4,7,1],"profit":7,"i":6},"depth":1}]}